    "explanation": "ctr_tail specializes ctr.T with tele_fill before TELES looks it up. Equivalent indexed arguments yield distinct specialized HTerm identities and therefore miss the cache. Memoizing before specialization and keying closed literal WCon indices 0..31 by value avoids this repeated allocation. Other single arguments use identity; multi-argument constructors use the original path. TAILS clears with existing per-definition caches."
  },
